WEBVTT

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:32.204
What that person is doing,
it hasn't changed, right?

00:07:32.228 --> 00:07:35.793
So primary appraisal doesn't change;
still bad, still blameworthy.

00:07:36.315 --> 00:07:39.156
But your ability
to cope with it sure does.

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.569
Because all of a sudden,

00:07:40.593 --> 00:07:42.760
you're going to be late
to that job interview.

00:07:42.784 --> 00:07:43.935
All of a sudden,

00:07:43.959 --> 00:07:45.869
you are not going to get your dream job,

00:07:45.893 --> 00:07:48.846
the one that was going to give you
piles and piles of money.

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:49.871
(Laughter)

00:07:49.895 --> 00:07:52.228
Somebody else is going to get
your dream job

00:07:52.252 --> 00:07:53.902
and you're going to be broke.

00:07:53.926 --> 00:07:55.355
You're going to be destitute.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:58.633
Might as well stop now, turn around,
move in with your parents.

00:07:58.657 --> 00:08:00.815
(Laughter)